<title>OMAN: Commercial Bank of Oman extends Housing Bank loan.</title>
<headline>Commercial Bank of Oman extends Housing Bank loan.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commercial Bank of Oman signed an agreement on Wednesday to extend a seven million rial loan to the Oman Housing Bank, the official Oman news agency reported.</p>
<p>It said the loan would carry an interest rate of 7.5 percent and would extend over seven years.</p>
</text>
